; Monstro — animated from the Rebirth fight (sprite sheet numbered 1-5 top,
; 6-9 bottom). Clips:
;   idle    = #3        (rest, all attacks return here)
;   attack  = #2 -> #4  (vomit: windup on #2, spew on #4, then back to idle)
;   jump    = #6 -> #7  (shared crouch: flatten then launch up; #7 rockets off-screen)
;   descend = #5        (big jump: falling back into view)
;   hopair  = #8        (hop: airborne, looking up)
;   landrec = #6 -> #9  (land then recover; shared by hop and big jump)
; Attacks: [0] big jump (rockets off-screen on #7, lands + tear barrage), [1]
; vomit (aimed lobbed spray, recoils him back), [2] short hop (on-screen
; body-slam). Boss brain, deliberately slow-paced, with squash-and-stretch.

